-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Jet Set Willy
  Publisher   Software Projects, 1984
  Version     1.2

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Jet Set Willy (1984)(Software Projects).z80
  MD5         a4963e747af1145fe0f2710da592abc6

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Changes     1.1: The Attic bug fixed (Software Projects' own POKE 59901,82),
              so the game can be completed.
              1.2: Starts on a Next: the game's stack sits in the printer
              buffer, which the loader overwrites; it is now put back before
              the game runs

  Note        Keys: Q and W (and the top row) left and right, SPACE jumps,
              ENTER starts. Starts at the title with no colour code to type.
              The Attic bug is fixed (the arrow there no longer wrecks other
              rooms), so the game can be finished. Willy, the guardians and
              the arrows are hardware sprites, so Willy is no longer the
              colour of whatever cell he walks through; the rooms, ropes and
              the panel stay as the game draws them.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite lives
   2  Walk through monsters
   3  No death from falling
   4  Remove maria

  From an archive .pok, each checked against this release's code: the lives
  DEC, the two collision exits in the figure drawing, the fall flag's store
  and Maria's test. Not played.

